@base = http://localhost:8080

### Create in Europe
POST {{base}}/continents/europe/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Copenhagen opens new harbour bath",
  "body": "The city has opened its fifth public swimming spot in the harbour.",
  "author": "Jane Doe",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-07T10:00:00Z"
}

### Create in Asia
POST {{base}}/continents/asia/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Tokyo park plants a thousand cherry trees",
  "body": "Volunteers spent the weekend planting along the riverbank.",
  "author": "John Smith",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-07T11:00:00Z"
}

### All in Europe
GET {{base}}/continents/europe/articles

### All in Asia
GET {{base}}/continents/asia/articles

### All in Africa
GET {{base}}/continents/africa/articles

### Invalid continent
GET {{base}}/continents/atlantis/articles